{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "七道关",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 87.45,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先把这条路画出来。",
   "spoken": "先把这条路画出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.184,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.959
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "假设一位用户，要从交易所提走 2 万 USDT。这是示例。",
   "spoken": "假设一位用户，要从交易所提走 2 万 USDT。这是示例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.004,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 4.102,
   "speechEnd": 8.742
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "第一关，业务意图。用户点下提现，账本里多了一张提现单。",
   "spoken": "第一关，业务意图。用户点下提现，账本里多了一张提现单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.816,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 9.914,
   "speechEnd": 15.292
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "第二关，请求构造。钱包后台把这张单子，翻译成一笔待签名的交易。",
   "spoken": "第二关，请求构造。钱包后台把这张单子，翻译成一笔待签名的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.348,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 16.446,
   "speechEnd": 21.967
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "第三关，风控与审批。规则检查金额和地址，大额还要有人批准。",
   "spoken": "第三关，风控与审批。规则检查金额和地址，大额还要有人批准。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.024,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 23.122,
   "speechEnd": 29.072
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "第四关，显示与解码。审批的人看不懂原始字节，他看到的，是翻译出来的文字。",
   "spoken": "第四关，显示与解码。审批的人看不懂原始字节，他看到的，是翻译出来的文字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.132,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 30.23,
   "speechEnd": 37.215
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "第五关，签名。可能是 MPC 节点，可能是硬件加密机，也可能是多签的签名人。",
   "spoken": "第五关，签名。可能是 MPC 节点，可能是硬件加密机，也可能是多签的签名人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.272,
   "dur": 7.968,
   "speechStart": 38.37,
   "speechEnd": 45.415
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "第六关，广播。签好的交易，发到链上。",
   "spoken": "第六关，广播。签好的交易，发到链上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 46.46,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 46.558,
   "speechEnd": 50.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "第七关，链上状态。余额变了。有时候，账户的代码和权限，也会跟着变。",
   "spoken": "第七关，链上状态。余额变了。有时候，账户的代码和权限，也会跟着变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 51.504,
   "dur": 8.016,
   "speechStart": 51.602,
   "speechEnd": 58.683
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "还有一条支线。有些系统要先读链上数据，再决定签不签。这些数据，来自 RPC 节点。",
   "spoken": "还有一条支线。有些系统要先读链上数据，再决定签不签。这些数据，来自 RPC 节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 59.74,
   "dur": 8.736,
   "speechStart": 59.838,
   "speechEnd": 67.645
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "注意每一个箭头。下游都默认，上游已经检查过了。",
   "spoken": "注意每一个箭头。下游都默认，上游已经检查过了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 68.696,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 68.794,
   "speechEnd": 73.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "从意图到链上，这整条链路，叫做签名路径。",
   "spoken": "从意图到链上，这整条链路，叫做签名路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 74.1,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 74.198,
   "speechEnd": 78.067
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "私钥，只待在第五关。攻击者要的，只是让第五关，签出他想要的东西。",
   "spoken": "私钥，只呆在第五关。攻击者要的，只是让第五关，签出他想要的东西。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 79.12,
   "dur": 7.128,
   "speechStart": 79.218,
   "speechEnd": 85.406
  }
